OL,3,GNEWSABauble tree honours former yarn
OL,4,Abomb mayor
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Christmas tree adorned with handmade
OL,7,Fbaubles has been made in memory of a
OL,8,Fformer mayor who was at the forefront
OL,9,Fof a town's yarn bomb group.
OL,11,FWhen Higham Ferrers in Northamptonshire
OL,12,Fcould not hold its annual Christmas
OL,13,FSparkle in 2020 during the Covid-19
OL,14,Flockdown, the town council called on
OL,15,Fthe community to knit and crochet
OL,16,Fdecorations.
OL,18,FTina Reavey, the mayor at the time,
OL,19,Fsaid it helped to "brighten people's
OL,20,Flives".
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
