OL,3,GNEWSABauble tree honours former yarn
OL,4,Abomb mayor
OL,5,
OL,6,FReavey, who died in September, became a
OL,7,Fmember of Higham Ferrers Yarn Bomb
OL,8,FGroup which was formed shortly
OL,9,Fafterwards, and was described by the
OL,10,Fcouncil as "a true force for good".
